  m_Text: "<color=#26D9FF><b>CORE GAMEPLAY & TACTICAL SYSTEMS</b></color>\nMulti-Team Tactical Arena (2\u20134 Squads: Alpha, Bravo, Charlie & Delta)\n7 Specialized Combat Operatives with 3D Staging & Custom Loadouts\n\n<color=#38EF7D><b>AUTONOMOUS AI & TELEMETRY ENGINE</b></color>\nTactical Squad AI with Dynamic Cover, Flanking, Revival & Anti-Stuck Vaulting\nReal-Time Match Telemetry Logger & Automated Markdown Analytics Reports\n\n<color=#FFBD2E><b>NETWORKING & INFRASTRUCTURE</b></color>\nUnity Relay Cross-Network Co-Op & Direct UDP LAN Synchronization\nBuilt with Unity 6 Universal Render Pipeline (URP)"
